opam-version: "2.0"
synopsis: "Dependencies for building and running xoshiro-simd's afl fuzz harness"
description: """
Not a package to install or publish -- this exists only to declare the
extra library needed to build afl/ocaml_fuzz/ (afl-persistent). It has no
build steps of its own.

Every stanza in afl/ocaml_fuzz/dune is gated with
`(enabled_if (= %{profile} afl))`, so a plain `dune build` never needs
afl-persistent (see the root dune file's comment). To build/run the fuzz
harness: opam install ./xoshiro-simd-afl.opam --deps-only, then from
within the xoshiro-simd source tree, e.g.
  dune build --profile afl afl/ocaml_fuzz/harness.exe
  dune exec --profile afl afl/ocaml_fuzz/harness.exe
or just `make` / `make fuzz` from afl/ (see afl/Makefile)."""
maintainer: ["Chris A <onetimerobot@protonmail.com>"]
authors: ["Chris A <onetimerobot@protonmail.com>"]
license: "ISC"
homepage: "https://github.com/luminous-moose/xoshiro-simd"
dev-repo: "git+https://github.com/luminous-moose/xoshiro-simd.git"
bug-reports: "https://github.com/luminous-moose/xoshiro-simd/issues"
depends: [
  "ocaml" {>= "4.13.0"}
  "dune" {>= "3.10.0"}
  "afl-persistent" {>= "1.0"}
]
build: []
